dist/
# Real registered git worktrees created by Agent(isolation: "worktree") /
# EnterWorktree with a `name` — not repo content, and nothing removes them
# automatically when a run ends (see universal-till/CLAUDE.md's "Agent
# worktree hygiene").
.claude/worktrees/
# A committed agent worktree is a stray gitlink that breaks actions/checkout (ut-docs#5289).
.worktrees/
